        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A beautifully glowing orb to be held by Palkia.\nIt boosts the power of Dragon- and Water-type\nmoves when it is held.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "パルキアに　持たせると　ドラゴンと\nみずタイプの　技の　威力が\nあがる　美しく　輝く　珠。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让帕路奇亚携带的话，\n龙和水属性的招式威力就会提高。\n散发着美丽光辉的宝珠。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una bonita esfera que potencia los movimientos de tipo\nDragón y Agua. Debe llevarla Palkia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
